     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">We have at least two upcoming INLA courses that are open for registration:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(228,175,10)\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/spatial-modelling-with-r-inla-workshop-tickets-48024306995\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/spatial-modelling-with-r-inla-workshop-tickets-48024306995&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443065965000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KmUqUV8NT1e7yUJWLc_24\">https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/spatial-modelling-with-r-inla-workshop-tickets-48024306995</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">This course is very applied, with a strong focus on landslides. We will not discuss deep statistical concepts, or the inner workings of the INLA algorithm.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(228,175,10)\"><a href=\"http://www.zhrcourses.uzh.ch/en/programm/Bayesian-inference-using-R-INLA.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.zhrcourses.uzh.ch/en/programm/Bayesian-inference-using-R-INLA.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443065965000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_v5ygehSyGFb9vPpJZUW-\">http://www.zhrcourses.uzh.ch/en/programm/Bayesian-inference-using-R-INLA.html</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">This course focuses on the practical use of INLA, but includes quite a bit of information on the statistical concepts and the inner workings of INLA.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Please add other INLA courses below (but only those open to registration by anyone).</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Kind regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Haakon</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><br></p></div>\r\n"
    ]
